Z||000001||jimmybpei||11-26-2001||04:43 PM||||Here it goes again <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mag_001.jpg"> <P>My 84  indy with 76000 km (40000 miles) bought it 7 yrs aga and have only put 500 mile on it<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mag_017.jpg"> <P>The 17" wheeel are gettin refinished for the caddy.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mag_016.jpg"> <P>GT fast back tails in a notch back with a Mustang saleen wing. This is the one going under the knife next (dec 1) NX nitrous.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mag_019.jpg"> <P>Caddy fiero Tavis's hood taken one step furthur, i like it so much i did it.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mag_021.jpg">  <BR>Clear tails JSP t2 wing Reactive dual 3' angled tips <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mag_020.jpg"> <BR>Side view, the car will still get dropped 2" (on their way) 17" enkie suzuka wheels with bfg 40's scorchers red. The car is painted NYFD RED.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mag_022.jpg"> <BR>Engine installed and running, still have to paint a few parts and clean & tiddy things up.<P><BR>Theit they are my 3 fieros. Will post the other cars later.<BR>Ski knows which ones they are<P>Later<BR>Jimmy B.<P><BR>||||reg||1
