Z||000007||jimmybpei||11-26-2001||08:22 PM||||Skitime- i've still got the lowrider, will post some pics later tommorrow. now that i've got the didgi cam i can post the progress on the yellow car this winter. i don't think i will be delivering that indy, think i would like to keep it. i took the for sale signs off it the day you left.<P>jelly- any weekend would be good for me as i very rarly woork weekends. Didn't know you raced carts, my buddys young fella race Gerald caisly Jr. my friend and i picked up carts from Hurrican Racing in To a month ago and now he will be travelling with him next summer, vegas , texas , oklahoma. his young fella is the best in canada but i forget his name (#12 i think) <P>kevin- The tails in the yellow are just extended quaters and an extended notchback trunk with a new support to hold the lites. The inside dosnt look all that pretty because it has never been finished inside. I just dont open the trunk that much.<P>As fot the red caddy, all the lenses have been removed and red bulbs put in <P>Later<BR>jimmy B.||||reg||1
